"""Second batch of club questions (2026-11-21) for the 2026-27 Premier League clubs, appended after the first 30.
Entry: (difficulty 1-3, kind, question, correct, [3 wrong], explanation, source_url).
Every fact was read on the source page on 2026-11-21."""
